{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41175","headline":"王泽岭遭洪水 · 孔德绍","name":"王泽岭遭洪水","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"地籁风声急，天津云色愁。\n悠然万顷满，俄尔百川浮。\n远似金堤溢，翻如碧海流。\n惊涛遥起鹭，回岸不分牛。\n徒知怀赵景，终是倦阳侯。\n木梗诚无托，芦灰岂暇求。\n思得乘槎便，萧然河汉游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孔德绍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41175.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41175","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}